{"data": [{"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2116535497963003904"]}, "author_id": "1727548535816724480", "created_at": "2026-10-31T14:19:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116535521644105826"], "id": "2116535521644105826", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 251, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "横向对比中国团队最新发布的三个 OCR 模型\n\n@OpenBMB @XiaomiTech_ @Baidu_Inc 分别发布了自己最新的 OCR 模型，MiniCPM-OCR-1.0、Xiaomi-OCR-0 和 Unlimited-OCR-2，三个模型 OCR 能力都很强，但也各有侧重，咱们展开看看。\n\nMiniCPM-OCR-1.0 (1.3B)\n以 MiniCPM-V 4.6：SigLIP + Qwen3.5 https://t.co/uijy9lY79e", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2116535521644105826"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2116516688741179393", "3_2116527120914759680", "3_2116527192113057792"]}, "author_id": "1727548535816724480", "created_at": "2026-10-31T13:48:39.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116527775662432308"], "id": "2116527775662432308", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 518, "like_count": 7, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 9, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115785693599523089", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "周末继续完整学习「2026 AI Agent 企业解决方案及落地实践手册」 \n\n这份腾讯、腾讯云和 WorkBuddy 联合发布的 78 页手册，来到第二章「内部提效 - 企业研发运维全链路提效」。\n\n这一章用六套方案加八个标杆案例，把内部场景铺成一条链：办公数字员工 → AI Coding → 游戏研发与运营 → SRE 故障定位 https://t.co/fK8futnCWc https://t.co/9bPizxr3xj", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2116527775662432308"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2116392173667045376"]}, "author_id": "1727548535816724480", "created_at": "2026-10-31T04:49:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116392189613740179"], "id": "2116392189613740179", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 984, "like_count": 11, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 15, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "周六上午跟儿子一起写这篇小短文，真的很短是吧，但他用了整整 100 分钟，成年人大概 1-2 分钟就能写完。\n\n这就是初学写字的孩子的真实状态，突然在想，这可能也是几年前我们看着不太聪明的 gpt-3，glm，文心，llama 那最早一批 llm 时的感觉，但再过两年，他肯定会越写越好，还可能超过我这个成年人。 https://t.co/S29vP2I6I9", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2116392189613740179"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2116345453335715840"]}, "author_id": "1727548535816724480", "created_at": "2026-10-31T01:44:14.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116345470125543768"], "id": "2116345470125543768", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 30, "impression_count": 3018, "like_count": 47, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 39, "retweet_count": 6}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115975663148765204", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "阿里云开源的「AI Agent Handbook」有一份「2026 Agent 开发者调研报告」\n\n做 Agent 已成共识，近半团队在做，真正进生产仍是少数（~18%）；卡点主要是工程配套（上下文与记忆、多模型路由与成本、评估与可观测），不是「要不要做」。单 Agent / 多 Agent / 人在回路会长期并存；Coding https://t.co/TbztQrZ1MP https://t.co/7AEHqtVcOM", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2116345470125543768"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2116341547935399937"]}, "author_id": "1727548535816724480", "created_at": "2026-10-31T01:28:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116341563638874332"], "id": "2116341563638874332", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 4, "impression_count": 1410, "like_count": 10, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 9, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116188879648911570", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Amp 回应「人人都能推 main」\n\n@AmpCode 团队不靠强制 PR 拦 AI 时代的「水货」代码，而是靠小团队、皮肤在局、公开反馈与共同品味；大架构变更可以在一条 Slack 线程和一次客户现场里定稿；适配器变便宜后，客户用 agent 自己补最后 20%；别用扩招逃避优先级，别迷信单测，用视频和截图当证据；token https://t.co/QtvxqrMGfj https://t.co/pOj10pZBSG", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2116341563638874332"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2116341333652590593"]}, "author_id": "1727548535816724480", "created_at": "2026-10-31T01:28:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116341478981349755"], "id": "2116341478981349755", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 896, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115986116482613486", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "这是触发了 AI Slop 回复的什么机制？咋两个 AI 还自己聊起来了 🤦🏻‍♀️ https://t.co/XqHJKe7fYg https://t.co/MgGBEBWZYm", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2116341478981349755"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2116335754624344064"]}, "author_id": "1727548535816724480", "created_at": "2026-10-31T01:05:45.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116335784626209071"], "id": "2116335784626209071", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 953, "like_count": 9, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 6, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115885628420141263", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Armin Ronacher 的 Qwen3-TTS 自定义音色笔记\n\nArmin 和孩子做地下城爬行小游戏时需要旁白，又不想用大众脸 AI 声线，就想到用 Qwen3-TTS 的 Base 克隆给出约 2048 维说话人嵌入；把它塞进 CustomVoice 的同一说话人槽位，就能在克隆音色上加「悲伤 / https://t.co/QUIjyiYyw3 https://t.co/LNDXkpw77F", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2116335784626209071"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2116335069677715456"]}, "author_id": "1727548535816724480", "created_at": "2026-10-31T01:02:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116335089546035522"], "id": "2116335089546035522", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 121, "impression_count": 5029, "like_count": 82, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 8, "retweet_count": 20}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116218859413987803", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "9集、230分钟 @jbhuang0604 系列视频「AI Training and Inference」把基座模型训练和推理基础讲清楚了，覆盖整个训推架构：单卡显存 → 千卡并行 → 便宜微调 → 推理加速 → 小模型蒸馏 → 推理 RL → 优化器（AdamW→Muon） \n\n这个训推系列的串联逻辑\n先解决「模型塞不进一张 https://t.co/RBxlW4oVQ6 https://t.co/LhmODq4a1L", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2116335089546035522"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2116333607191027712"]}, "author_id": "1727548535816724480", "created_at": "2026-10-31T00:57:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116333626233094159"], "id": "2116333626233094159", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 893, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 6, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115868430897385497", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "著名加密品牌 Proton 对内正在强推 AI 写码与流程改造：CEO Andy Yen 在 Slack 用「loser thinking」压制安全侧放慢请求，CTO 发 AI 宣言称「旧工作没了」，公司并对员工做 AI 使用复面；员工侧感到恐惧文化，官方未否认事实描述，只承认沟通过硬、会改进。\nhttps://t.co/mnlbA9rmSX\n\n公开人设 vs https://t.co/9vS4ZdIw7i https://t.co/qKwruQCVjN", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2116333626233094159"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2116330529851052032", "3_2116330678321131520"]}, "author_id": "1727548535816724480", "created_at": "2026-10-31T00:45:31.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116330695270277159"], "id": "2116330695270277159", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 87, "impression_count": 5715, "like_count": 85, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 33, "retweet_count": 19}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115785693599523089", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "周末开始完整学习「2026 AI Agent 企业解决方案及落地实践手册」\n\n这份腾讯、腾讯云和 WorkBuddy 联合发布的 78 页手册，今天先从第一章「AI 整体解决方案」开始！\n\n第一章把腾讯云 Agent 叙事收成一条链：WorkBuddy 当办公入口与数字员工 → ClawPro 做开通与统一管控 → Agent Runtime https://t.co/mz9BwNozkU https://t.co/9bPizxqvHL", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2116330695270277159"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2116328480979685376"]}, "author_id": "1727548535816724480", "created_at": "2026-10-31T00:36:48.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116328500936265843"], "id": "2116328500936265843", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 1179, "like_count": 12, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 13, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115394340357116169", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "这个想法很疯狂！\n\nQwenputer 在 Qwen3.5-4B 上用编译器把一台确定性 RISC-V CPU 写进额外层与权重，并把模型自带的 Gated DeltaNet (GDN) 状态当可寻址 RAM，在前向里跑加减乘除、C 和 MicroPython，不调外部 runtime；大数运算接近「基座 + Python 工具」，还顺手塞进实验性「硬盘」。 https://t.co/vP412lhAE0 https://t.co/D28W0P0itU", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2116328500936265843"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2116062339720196096"]}, "author_id": "1727548535816724480", "created_at": "2026-10-30T07:01:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116062951279091969"], "id": "2116062951279091969", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 103, "impression_count": 8096, "like_count": 121, "quote_count": 3, "reply_count": 26, "retweet_count": 18}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112397032912719957", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "给孩子的键盘打字游戏更新了一版，加入了打句子的模块\n\n需求来源是：孩子每次打字，首字母大写、单词间空格、结束后句号，这些他手写时都能注意，但打字时就很容易记不住。因为这个没少被妈妈说。\n\n能用 AI 用软件训练解决的问题，咱就别让妈妈一直说了，浪费时间还大家都不高兴 😄 https://t.co/N0zeGFaFoW https://t.co/wNVWlLRLOK", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2116062951279091969"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2115999245719515136"]}, "author_id": "1727548535816724480", "created_at": "2026-10-30T02:48:32.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115999263121699221"], "id": "2115999263121699221", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 7, "impression_count": 3278, "like_count": 11, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 8, "retweet_count": 2}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115821783085711549", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "来自中国的首个第三方评测实验室 @FangcunLeap 提交了一份 87 页的针对 DeepSeek V4.1 Flash-1017 安全评测报告，评测它在失控与有害操纵上的表现\n\n报告结论总结下来：相对 DeepSeek V4 一代，V4.1 Flash-1017 https://t.co/iWGtyVMhPI https://t.co/LsuJq4RBFt", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2115999263121699221"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2115991595036397568"]}, "author_id": "1727548535816724480", "created_at": "2026-10-30T02:18:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115991611306086574"], "id": "2115991611306086574", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 4, "impression_count": 1554, "like_count": 13, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 9, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115805862837264832", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "用 Cursor 云端电脑「看着真正的 Slack」把界面做成代码视频\n\n来自 @mattyp 的实战演示，整体覆盖：Why → Cursor agents &amp; computer use → Video as code → Slack → 聊天·Agent·电脑 → 内环/外环 → The ladder → Skills → Feedback loops → Recap。\n\n演示看起来是「Agent 复刻 Slack https://t.co/KOmi79LMhQ https://t.co/46sZ8WwwxY", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2115991611306086574"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2115986100137365504"]}, "author_id": "1727548535816724480", "created_at": "2026-10-30T01:56:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115986116482613486"], "id": "2115986116482613486", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 27, "impression_count": 4258, "like_count": 32, "quote_count": 3, "reply_count": 45, "retweet_count": 5}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115688494865465370", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Addy 谈 Claude Opus 5.5 时代怎么用 Claude Code\n\nClaude 5 系列模型开始，对「堆提示词、手把手拆任务」的依赖已经下降；更有效的做法是一条说清目标与验收方式的提示，让模型自己跑完并停下来。旧时代为弱模型写的长系统提示、强制拆子 agent、人肉盯多会话，往往在增加成本，却不一定更聪明。 https://t.co/yb35aoN1Iu https://t.co/n2qHSLJqur", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2115986116482613486"}, {"author_id": "1727548535816724480", "created_at": "2026-10-30T01:28:31.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115979125630624028"], "id": "2115979125630624028", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1115, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115785693599523089", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "需要 PDF 的朋友，留言后可以私信给我发一条信息，因为留言评论会被刷掉或隐藏看不到。", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2115979125630624028"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2115975646874914816"]}, "author_id": "1727548535816724480", "created_at": "2026-10-30T01:14:45.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115975663148765204"], "id": "2115975663148765204", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 268, "impression_count": 14701, "like_count": 178, "quote_count": 3, "reply_count": 34, "retweet_count": 32}, "text": "阿里云开源《AI Agent Handbook》：用 Harness 把企业 Agent 从试点推到可治理生产\n\n企业级 Agent 全生命周期实践手册：架构、构建、运行、治理、调优，外加调研与案例，开源地址：\nhttps://t.co/DcfrmPCtWe\n\n手册为何重写？ https://t.co/5ywcVSIMME", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2115975663148765204"}, {"author_id": "1727548535816724480", "created_at": "2026-10-29T15:40:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115831262435000725"], "id": "2115831262435000725", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 816, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115829611812798649", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "上面说的 REA 或从零构建自己的 Video Agent，不全面，补充一个更现实的实现路径：\n把你的 Codex\\Claude Code\\Grok Bot 等作为主 Agent，给他们视频生成 API Key，再搭配一些视频剪辑知识和 ffmpeg 等 skills，试试效果。", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2115831262435000725"}, {"author_id": "1727548535816724480", "created_at": "2026-10-29T15:34:24.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115829611812798649"], "id": "2115829611812798649", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 5, "impression_count": 2549, "like_count": 9, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 15, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115378725563035803", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "之前合作过一个 Video Agent 产品，对国内的 LibTV、TapNow、Flova、Pexo、Medeo 等团队多少有一些了解，创业目标、融资路演里肯定都有对生态、Agent 架构、行业 know-how、对 C 端用户需求理解深度等壁垒的反复强调，但是。。。\n\n做来做去，可能都做成了 token 中转站 😂\n\n想一想，如果这些网站支持 https://t.co/xUcyVNgsS1", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2115829611812798649"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2115783183635767297"]}, "author_id": "1727548535816724480", "created_at": "2026-10-29T12:39:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115785693599523089"], "id": "2115785693599523089", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 387, "impression_count": 30400, "like_count": 241, "quote_count": 5, "reply_count": 199, "retweet_count": 34}, "text": "腾讯、腾讯云和 WorkBuddy 联合发布了一份 78 页的「2026 AI Agent 企业解决方案及落地实践手册」\n\n整份材料用同一条产品叙事串起来：先用 WorkBuddy 把个人助手推成进业务系统的「数字员工」，再用 ClawPro、Agent Runtime、TokenHub https://t.co/QCFlI9I5EL", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2115785693599523089"}], "includes": {"media": [{"media_key": "3_2116535497963003904", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2116516688741179393", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2116527120914759680", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2116527192113057792", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2116392173667045376", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2116345453335715840", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2116341547935399937", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "13_2116341333652590593", "type": "video"}, {"media_key": "3_2116335754624344064", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2116335069677715456", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2116333607191027712", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2116330529851052032", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2116330678321131520", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2116328480979685376", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "13_2116062339720196096", "type": "video"}, {"media_key": "3_2115999245719515136", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2115991595036397568", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2115986100137365504", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2115975646874914816", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2115783183635767297", "type": "photo"}]}, "meta": {"newest_id": "2116535521644105826", "oldest_id": "2115785693599523089", "result_count": 20}}